## Yacht suites

The suites range from 16 to 80 sq. m, including bathrooms.

Features include:

- bathrooms finished in Italian marble;
- a spacious shower cubicle and rain shower;
- toiletries made from natural organic materials;
- large wardrobes with an electronic safe;
- wall-to-wall carpeting;
- solid walnut veneer panelling;
- large windows that let in natural light.
